@baseUrl = http://bcserver:7048/BC/api

### 1. Lister les entreprises (copiez l'id de votre entreprise ci-dessous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2.0/companies
Authorization: Basic admin MotDePasse123!

### 2. API standard v2.0 : lister les clients
@companyId = 233157a0-f5bb-f111-85bd-6045bdfdea7c

GET {{baseUrl}}/v2.0/companies({{companyId}})/customers?$top=5
Authorization: Basic admin MotDePasse123!

### 3. Votre API : lister les unites
GET {{baseUrl}}/bclearning/tracker/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})/trainingUnits
Authorization: Basic admin MotDePasse123!

### 4. Votre API : creer une unite
POST {{baseUrl}}/bclearning/tracker/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})/trainingUnits
Authorization: Basic admin MotDePasse123!
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleName": "Application Types",
  "unitNo": 4,
  "title": "Find development resources"
}

### 5. Votre API : modifier le statut (remplacez l'id par celui retourne en 3 ou 4)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bclearning/tracker/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})/trainingUnits(ID-DE-L-UNITE)
Authorization: Basic admin MotDePasse123!
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: *

{
  "status": "Completed"
}